#~ " default target, the first one "
#~ "defined in the Makefile.  By tradition"
#~ " (including in the CPython project) "
#~ "this is usually the ``all`` target. "
#~ "The ``configure`` script expands an "
#~ "``autoconf`` variable, ``@DEF_MAKE_ALL_RULE@`` to"
